//News
//News#Language#id#Text

News#English#9#Welcome to MotorStorm RC! Press X on this panel to catch up on RC news!

News#English#10#Get more news, updates and advice on Twitter: Follow @MotorStormRC

News#English#11#...and if you're on Facebook, like the /MotorStormRC page!

News#English#12#Tell your friends about the FREE TRIAL and start challenging them! 

News#English#19#Go further. Expand your game with the PRO-AM pack from PlayStation®Store!
News#Danish#19#Pro-Am-udvidelsespakke er i butikken nu!
News#Dutch#19#Pro-Am-uitbreidingspack is nu verkrijgbaar in de Store!
News#Finnish#19#Pro-Am-laajennuspaketti on Storessa nyt!
News#French#19#Pack d'expansion Pro-Am est disponible !
News#German#19#Das neue Pro-Am-Erweiterung ist ab sofort im PlayStation®Store erhältlich!
News#Italian#19#Disponibile su PlayStation®Store: Pack di espansione Semi-pro!
News#Norwegian#19#Pro-Am-utvidelsespakke er i butikken nå!
News#Polish#19#Dodatek Pro-Am jest dostępny w sklepie PlayStation Store!
News#Portuguese#19#O Pack de Expansão Pro-Am já está disponível na PlayStation®Store!
News#Spanish#19#¡Pack de expansion Pro-Am ya está en la Tienda!
News#Swedish#19#Expansionspaket Pro-Am är i Store nu!
News#Russian#19#Дополнение «Полупрофессионал» - уже в продаже!

News#English#24#Get the CARNIVAL upgrade to enjoy: 24 events, 8 vehicles, 6 tracks, 4 Trophies!
News#Danish#24#Carnival-udvidelsespakke er i butikken nu!
News#Dutch#24#Carnival-uitbreidingspack is nu verkrijgbaar in de Store!
News#Finnish#24#Carnival-laajennuspaketti on Storessa nyt!
News#French#24#Pack d'extension Carnaval est disponible !
News#German#24#Das neue Karneval-Erweiterung ist ab sofort im PlayStation®Store erhältlich!
News#Italian#24#Disponibile su PlayStation®Store: Pack espansione Fiera!
News#Norwegian#24#Tivoliutvidelsespakke er i butikken nå!
News#Polish#24#Dodatek Karnawał jest dostępny w sklepie PlayStation Store!
News#Portuguese#24#O Pack de Expansão Carnival já está disponível na PlayStation®Store!
News#Russian#24#Набор загружаемых материалов «Карнавал» - уже в продаже! 
News#Spanish#24#¡Pack de expansión Carnaval ya está en la Tienda!
News#Swedish#24#Expansionspaket Carnival är i Store nu!

News#English#26#Beat 10 Pitwall challenges to earn a Silver Trophy! Keep challenging to help eachother!

News#English#31#What are your friends driving? Hit Triangle on their activity in the Pitwall to see!

News#English#32#Check your RC Car Collection - do you have them all?

News#English#33#Go back to the races you were stuck on - we've re-tuned the Festival!

News#English#34#You can now challenge anyone from race Leaderboards! Flip any race and press Square!

News#English#36#The free trial now includes Drifting - go challenge your friends on Apocalypse 'Sky High'!

News#English#37#Like the music from the game? It's available to download now from PlayStation®Store! 

